Milestone 10 – Automation with Flow

Activity 1: Auto-Populate Enrollment Date (Record-Triggered Flow)

Purpose:
Set Enrollment_Date__c to today when Enrollment is created.

Steps:

Go to Setup → Flows → New Flow.
Select Record-Triggered Flow → Create.
Object: Enrollment__c.
Trigger: A record is created.
Optimize for Actions and Related Records → Done.

Add Update Records element:
Label: Set Enrollment Date.
Use a record that triggered the flow.
Field: Enrollment_Date__c → Value: $Flow.CurrentDate.
7.Save as SetEnrollmentDate → Activate.






Activity 2: Send Email When Enrollment Approved

Purpose:
When Enrollment_Status__c = Approved, send email, alert admin, and set Student to Active.
Steps (high level for document):

Create Email Template and Email Alert for student notification.

Go to Flows → New → Record-Triggered Flow.
Object: Enrollment__c, Trigger on update.
Condition: Enrollment_Status__c Equals "Approved".

Add Get Records to fetch related Student__c.

Add Action (Email Alert) to send email to student.

Add Action to notify Admin if needed.
Add Update Records to set Student__c.Status__c = "Active".

Save as Enrollment Approved Action → Activate.


Activity 3: Auto-Assign Instructor Based on Course Category

Purpose:
Assign Instructor automatically based on Course category.

Rules:

Technical → Instructor A
Language → Instructor B
Non-Technical → Instructor C


Steps:


Prepare Instructor__c records with codes (e.g., INSTR_A, INSTR_B, INSTR_C).
Create Record-Triggered Flow on Enrollment__c (created/updated).
Add Get Records to fetch related Course__c.
Add Decision element on Course__r.Category__c:
Technical / Language / Non-Technical outcomes.
For each outcome:
Get Instructor record (A/B/C) based on code or name.
Update Records: set Instructor__c = Get_Instructor_X.Id.
Save as AutoAssign_Instructor → Activate.



Activity 4: Auto-Create Task for Follow-Up

Purpose:
When Enrollment is “Requested”, create a follow-up task for Admin.

Steps:

Create Record-Triggered Flow on Enrollment__c.
Trigger: Record created or updated; condition Enrollment_Status__c = "Requested".

Add Get Records to fetch Admin user (by Username / Profile).
Add Formula (Date): TODAY() + 2 for due date.

Add Create Records for Task:
Subject: Follow up on enrollment request.
OwnerId: Admin user Id.
WhatId: Enrollment Id.
ActivityDate: formula Today + 2.

Save as Create_Followup_Task → Activate.
